1. Navigate to the React frontend:

cd frontend/react-app

2. Install the frontend dependencies:

npm install

3. Start the React development server:

npm run dev

4. Open the URL shown in the terminal, usually:

http://localhost:5173/

FRONTEND TECHNOLOGIES

- React
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- vite-plugin-pwa

TAILWIND SETUP

Tailwind CSS is installed through the Vite plugin.

The Tailwind configuration is located in:
frontend/react-app/vite.config.js

The main stylesheet is:
frontend/react-app/src/index.css

PWA SETUP

The PWA functionality is configured through vite-plugin-pwa in:

frontend/react-app/vite.config.js

The PWA is currently configured with:
- App name: PillBug
- Short name: PillBug
- Display mode: standalone
- Automatic updates

PWA icons still need to be added once the PillBug logo is finalized.